Package: progression
Title: Prediction Algorithm Generalizing to Unobserved Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Gloria", "Buritica", , "gloria.buritica@agroparistech.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8527-1165"))
Description: An algorithm featuring accurate non-parametric predictions.
    Classical non-parametric methods predict well only on new data broadly
    represented during training but don't generalize to previously
    unobserved data. The 'progression' algorithm guarantees a satisfactory
    generalization on underrepresented test data.
